[*] ucie2-pipe7-bridge -- default waveform layout (Phase G increment 3).
[*] Curated debug view of the directed Gen5 FDI round-trip: FDI in, link FSM,
[*] ingress -> Gen5 framer -> PIPE TX, PHY loopback, PIPE RX -> deframer ->
[*] egress -> FDI out, plus PIPE MAC control and bridge status.
[*]
[*] Authored BY GTKWave (headless, xvfb + `gtkwave -S`), so every net path below
[*] is exactly the name GTKWave resolves in the real dump. `make wave-check`
[*] re-proves that against a fresh dump on every run -- see tools/wave_check.py.
[*]
[*] wave-check-target: pyuvm test_roundtrip
